{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "gateVersion": "1.0.0",
  "notes": [
    "Predeclared release gate for FSB v1.0.0 (Phase 71, D-11). Frozen before V1: any change needs a new gateVersion file and a new sha256 pin in tests/bench-gate.test.mjs.",
    "Rounds come from the seeded power simulation (71-04; seed 71, 4000 reps): R = 30 for every campaign, met true. Rounds only go up; the completion margin never moves.",
    "Power at R 30 and floor completion 0.8: jev-ni 0.92125, claude-ni 0.92325, sentinel-equivalence 0.8465, sentinel-speed 1.",
    "V1 must run --rounds 30 for core-baseline-66; the pin runner has no gate preflight, so the rounds are checked by hand (M-71-01b).",
    "spend at 30 rounds per arm: V1 720 core runs, V4 autopilot 720 runs, V4 Claude 360 runs (defaults 240, 480, 120); 1800 paid runs instead of 840",
    "The optional core-rebaseline-71 fallback adds 2 x 12 x 30 = 720 Claude runs if the owner runs it at V4.",
    "acted attempt: fallback === null && op !== null && stepOutcome !== null (68-04); jev.acted is true when at least one attempt acted.",
    "intention to treat: the fast condition means switch on, whether or not Jev acted; a per-protocol view appears only under diagnostics (D-10).",
    "speed reads only wallMs on the runner's clock; per-decision Jev latency and jevMs are diagnostics, never whole-task speed (D-10, D-18).",
    "Both Jev verdicts come from run_task in core-gate-71-autopilot; the side-panel start path is not driven separately (D-05).",
    "false done: a typed done on a checker-failed run counts as claimedSuccessOnFail (D-09 item 3)",
    "an 'on' run with no Jev attempt is known exposure: acted false, never unknown (2026-10-16 decision)",
    "condition leak: any counted 'off' row with jev.source not null makes the Jev verdicts not_exercised (D-16, 2026-10-16)",
    "unknown exposure (jev.acted null) counts as acted for rule (a); cost in power.safetyTable at unknownShare 0.1; owner sign-off M-71-00 item 1",
    "p in power.safetyTable is the per-run rate of any safety event, claimedSuccessOnFail included",
    "safety rules are D-15 as locked; false-fail rates with no true difference are in power.safetyTable; owner sign-off M-71-00 after the V1 smoke, before the V1 campaign",
    "Example at R 30, p 0.01, acted share 0.5: rule (a) fails 0.8425 with no true difference, 0.8615 at unknown share 0.1.",
    "core-rebaseline-71 may replace only an inconclusive non-Jev verdict caused by a listed trigger",
    "Discretion numbers at their defaults: minActedShare 0.5, sentinel speedBand [0.80, 1.25] (sentinel-speed passes at R), non-Jev ciUpperAtMost 1.10.",
    "Claim words: autopilot status words at the pin and now (71-SYNC-RECHECK S12); a Claude run claims success with completeTask true.",
    "verifySuites: the tighten-only and escalation suites of 71-SYNC-RECHECK S14; the evaluator runs them at the measured SHA (--verify-suites).",
    "A path passes only when every criterion passes; no adjustment across the two families; Bonferroni intervals print as a sensitivity line (D-14)."
  ],
